% A number is encoded from its value, not its source text, so 007 is the fact 7
% again.  The rest pin number_text()'s two branches as injective: 1000000 and
% 1000001 either side of %.6g's six significant digits, and, above 2^53 where
% the encoding switches to %.17g, two values one double apart at 1e17 that
% %.6g would render identically.
n(1000000).
n(1000001).
n(-1000000).
n(100000000000000000).
n(100000000000000016).
n(0).
n(7).
n(007).
